{"id":"vod_sn_35749","vodId":"35749","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"世界征服～谋略之星～","name_cn":"世界征服～谋略之星～","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/18f12eb3b18ebd6b1ec1a13b9ddf04c8.jpg"},"summary":"地纹明日汰（花江夏树 配音）是一名平凡的初中二年级男生，某日，离家出走的他偶然遇见了名为星宫凯特（久野美咲 配音）的女孩，星宫凯特虽然长了一副萝莉般的可爱身材和面孔，其真实身份却是企图征服世界的秘密组织“星”的首领。在阴差阳错之下，地纹明日汰被卷入了“星”的战斗之中，成为了一名战斗员。　　腹黑高傲的抖S女鹿羽逸花（伊濑茉莉也 配音）、生得碧眼金发却一口广岛腔的娜塔莎（花泽香菜 配音）、机器人罗伯子（山崎惠理 配音），组织里的最底层生物亚斯（鸟海浩辅 配音），加入“星”后，这些稀奇古怪的角色们接二连三的出现在了明日汰的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:37:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H1wY95cqdT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y2KTsr3YvQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G3Fa0EUwRv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8Xs1jaSztg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8zrjU9jbpw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zNFh0kP96a1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ghAswenKWG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SY3NUCUAGf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zw0kX83vZW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sRc9NDQ0pF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aXTTXJ3RBZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uYN3jCL9Sd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/m0ZnC6g7Xn1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:31.115Z"}